<title>AUSTRIA: Creditanstalt opens eighth branch in Poland.</title>
<headline>Creditanstalt opens eighth branch in Poland.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's Creditanstalt said on Tuesday its Polish subsidiary had opened a branch in Gdansk, its eighth office in Poland.</p>
<p>The branch would provide banking services for both retail and corporate customers, Creditanstalt said in a statement.</p>
<p>The group's Polish unit Creditanstalt S.A. already operates eight branches across the country. The unit's total assets stood at 1.2 billion zloty at the end of last year.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
